                    Only; Operational Immediate. The substantive portion of this telegram is printed
                    in the Pentagon Papers: Gravel Edition, vol. 11, p. 735.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d285-f2" n="2" xml:id="d285-f2-content">
